  "decision_summary": "The query molecule is phencyclidine (PCP), a small, lipophilic, basic tertiary amine with very low PSA and no hydrogen-bond donors. High-transfer experimental analogues with piperidine, tertiary-amine, and lipophilic aromatic features consistently demonstrate high brain uptake and BBB permeation, supporting meaningful CNS access.",
